{"4057030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Skies Scrapper", "steam_appid": 4057030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if the only way forward was up?<br>In <strong>Skies Scrapper</strong>, you wield a mysterious gravity gun that lets you lift, toss, and stack objects of all shapes and sizes. Pile furniture, crates, trees—anything you can get your hands on—to create towering structures that scrape the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you climb higher, you’ll discover keys and glowing gems that upgrade your strength, allowing you to pick up bigger and stranger objects. Each new height reveals challenges, puzzles, and a story about what waits above the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will your tower hold steady, or come tumbling down?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌀 <strong>Gravity Gun Gameplay</strong> – Move, stack, and launch objects in creative ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>Physics-Based Puzzles</strong> – Every climb is a balance of skill, creativity, and chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏗️ <strong>Sandbox Creativity</strong> – No single solution—experiment, build wild towers, and see what works.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💎 <strong>Progression System</strong> – Collect gems to grow stronger and lift bigger objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌌 <strong>Reach the Unknown</strong> – A mysterious story unfolds the higher you climb.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>Casual &amp; Replayable</strong> – No two climbs are ever the same.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if the only way forward was up?<br>In <strong>Skies Scrapper</strong>, you wield a mysterious gravity gun that lets you lift, toss, and stack objects of all shapes and sizes. Pile furniture, crates, trees—anything you can get y